From: Tomasz Pakuła <tomasz.pakula.oficjalny@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] amdgpu: Add CH7218 PCON to the VRR whitelist (7.3.x)

Chrontel CH7218 found in Ugreen DP -> HDMI 2.1 adapter (model 85564)
works perfectly with VRR after testing.
---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_helpers.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm_helpers.c
@@ -1648,6 +1648,7 @@ STATIC_IFN_KUNIT const uint32_t dm_freesync_pcon_whitelist[] = {
 	DP_BRANCH_DEVICE_ID_0060AD,
 	DP_BRANCH_DEVICE_ID_00E04C,
 	DP_BRANCH_DEVICE_ID_90CC24,
+	0x2B02F0, /* Chrontel CH7218 */
 	DP_BRANCH_DEVICE_ID_001CF8,
 	DP_BRANCH_DEVICE_ID_001FF2,
 };
